<title>USA: Northwest Airlines pilots awarded raise.</title>
<headline>Northwest Airlines pilots awarded raise.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines Corp said Wednesday its pilots have been awarded a three percent raise by an arbitrator.</p>
<p>The raise is retroactive to October 31, Northwest said.  </p>
<p>The three percent raise was the maximum the pilots could have received in the arbitration case, a Northwest spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The airline had argued for a smaller amount, she said.</p>
<p>Northwest shares closed up 1/8 at 39 Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
